n white wall background.\nPhotorealistic full body shot from low angle below, subject standing looking down at camera, upward camera angle full figure, wearing black ribbed strapless bandeau top and black high-waisted dress pants, against a plain white wall background.\nHyperrealistic full body portrait from high angle above, subject standing looking up at camera, downward camera angle full figure, wearing black ribbed strapless bandeau top and black high-waisted dress pants, against a plain white wall background.\nDSLR full body shot, subject leaning against white wall with arms crossed, frontal view relaxed pose, wearing black ribbed strapless bandeau top and black high-waisted dress pants, against a plain white wall background.\nUltra-realistic full body portrait, subject in walking pose mid-stride from three-quarter angle 45 degrees, dynamic side view, wearing black ribbed strapless bandeau top and black high-waisted dress pants, against a plain white wall background.\nPhotorealistic full body shot from back, rear view of subject looking over shoulder at camera, back view with head turned, wearing black ribbed strapless bandeau top and black high-waisted dress pants, against a plain white wall background.\nHyperrealistic full body portrait, subject sitting on floor with legs crossed looking at camera, seated frontal view, wearing black ribbed strapless bandeau top and black high-waisted dress pants, against a plain white wall background.\nPhotorealistic 3/4 body shot from waist up, subject facing camera directly with arms relaxed at sides, frontal view torso, wearing black ribbed strapless bandeau top and black high-waisted dress pants, against a plain white wall background.\nHyperrealistic 3/4 body portrait from waist up, subject in three-quarter turn angled 45 degrees looking over shoulder, partial side view torso, wearing black ribbed strapless bandeau top and black high-waisted dress pants, against a plain white wall background.\nDSLR 3/4 body shot from chest up, subject with arms crossed casually, angled 45 degrees from camera, three-quarter view upper body, wearing black ribbed strapless bandeau top, against a plain white wall background.\nUltra-realistic 3/4 body portrait from waist up, subject leaning slightly forward towards camera, frontal view with forward lean, wearing black ribbed strapless bandeau top and black high-waisted dress pants, against a plain white wall background.\nPhotorealistic 3/4 body shot from hips up, subject in profile view turned 90 degrees with one arm visible at side, side view torso, wearing black ribbed strapless bandeau top and black high-waisted dress pants, against a plain white wall background.\nHyperrealistic 3/4 body portrait from waist up, subject facing camera with weight shifted to one leg in casual stance, frontal view casual pose, wearing black ribbed strapless bandeau top and black high-waisted dress pants, against a plain white wall background.\nDSLR 3/4 body shot from torso up, subject with hands on hips facing camera directly, frontal view confident pose, wearing black ribbed strapless bandeau top and black high-waisted dress pants, against a plain white wall background.\nUltra-realistic 3/4 body portrait from chest up, subject in three-quarter view angled 45 degrees with one shoulder forward, partial side view upper body, wearing black ribbed strapless bandeau top, against a plain white wall background.\n",
